        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion TB-B9, Traditional Rope Towel Bar</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in 5 traditional finishes, the Oval Rope Mount Towel Bar is a great way to add classic beauty back into the bathroom. With ultra-modern trends flooding the market, it is becoming hard to find classic styles for the discerning eye. This towel bar features rope detailing along the mount edge--a true classic and for good reason. Choose from an 18 inch, 24 inch, or 30 inch lengths.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: \r\n<a href=\"/products/oval-rope-mount-towel-ring-fusion-tr-b9\"><b>Fusion TR-B9 Oval Rope Mount Towel Ring</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/oval-rope-mount-robe-hook-fusion-rh-b9\"><b>Fusion RH-B9 Oval Rope Mount Robe Hook</b></a>, and\r\n<a href=\"/products/oval-rope-mount-toilet-paper-holder-fusion-ph-b9\"><b>Fusion PH-B9 Oval Rope Mount Toilet Paper Holder</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>TB-1-B9</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 3-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>TB-2-B9</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 3-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>TB-3-B9</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 30\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 3-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
